#: src/postulo_templates/plugin.py
msgid "More themes to set a CV in, beside Postulo's own: a CV laid out as the Europass CV is. Switched off, the themes are no longer offered, and a document set in one of them is drawn in the plain theme until it is switched on again."
msgstr "Méi Designen, fir e CV ze setzen, nieft deene vum Postulo: e CV, deen esou opgebaut ass wéi den Europass-CV. Ausgeschalt ginn d'Designen net méi ugebueden, an en Dokument, dat an engem dovu gesat ass, gëtt am schlichten Design gezeechent, bis et erëm ugeschalt gëtt."

